Glue Catalog IAM Policy Template ​
Below is an example of an IAM policy template that provides full access to the Glue Catalog for the Lakehouse role . iomete-glue-catalog-policy.json
{
"Version" : "2012-10-17" ,
"Statement" : [
{
"Sid" : "AllConnectors" ,
"Effect" : "Allow" ,
"Action" : [
"glue:*"
] ,
"Resource" : [
"arn:aws:glue:<region>:<aws-account-number>:*"
]
}
]
}
Please replace <region> and <aws-account-number> with your AWS region and account number respectively.
Example
